# Allowlist build inputs so new local directories never enter the context; excluded Git metadata is passed as build arguments.
*

# Inputs for go build ./cmd/mdm.
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
# Exclude tests so test-only changes do not invalidate the Go build layer.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata

!web/
**/node_modules
# Use SPA output from the web stage, never a local build.
web/dist
web/.vite-build-check
web/playwright-report
web/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
# Exclude nested secrets and logs too; Vite reads web/.env.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
